        "title": "Tenant B User",
        "description": "Synthetic reference design, not an observed deployment or security/compliance certification. External user in tenant-synthetic-b, using the same service instances and distinct authorized records/claims.\n\nPrivacy/retention: Business content persists only in its own tenant partition while active, with an illustrative 30-day account-closure/backup-expiry policy. Tenant IDs are OII, user references EUPI, permission claims Access Control Data, support identity Administrator Data and case material Support Data. Support response and approval/query context are processing-only; no cross-tenant batch or local download is authorized.",
