        },
        "color": "#bbf7d0"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_support",
        "dfdRoleLegacy": false,
        "title": "Support Reviewer",
        "description": "Synthetic reference design, not an observed deployment or security/compliance certification. External privileged support operator using a controlled administration client. Must authenticate as a user, obtain time-bound tenant/case approval and view only the approved Tenant A response. No durable local export is intended; downloaded copies would require a separate reviewed workflow.\n\nPrivacy/retention: Business content persists only in its own tenant partition while active, with an illustrative 30-day account-closure/backup-expiry policy. Tenant IDs are OII, user references EUPI, permission claims Access Control Data, support identity Administrator Data and case material Support Data. Support response and approval/query context are processing-only; no cross-tenant batch or local download is authorized.",
        "type": "SupportTool",
