        "title": "Pooled connection tenant bleed",
        "description": "Reference review concern: Test A/B alternation on reused SQL connections, forged tenant parameters and missing tenant context against row-level predicates.",
        "status": "Active",
        "createdAt": 1790969400000,
        "replies": []
      },
      {
        "id": "i_sample_2",
        "origin": "authored-threat",
        "justification": "Verify the named boundary-crossing controls before implementation approval. A declared requirement or clean deterministic result is not assurance.",
